{"comment_text": {"ja40:0.1": "", "ja40:0.2": "", "ja40:0.3": "", "ja40:0.4": "", "ja40:1.1": "Māra, in order to prevent the Bodhisatta from giving alms to a Paccekabuddha, creates an illusion of a vast pit burning with coals of acacia wood. But the Bodhisatta is not intimidated. ", "ja40:1.2": "", "ja40:1.3": "", "ja40:1.4": "", "ja40:2.1": "", "ja40:2.2": "", "ja40:3.1": "", "ja40:4.1": "", "ja40:4.2": "", "ja40:4.3": "", "ja40:4.4": ""}, "html_text": {"ja40:0.1": "<article id='ja40'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja40:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja40:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja40:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja40:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja40:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja40:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja40:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja40:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja40:2.2": "<p class='endvagga'>{}</p>", "ja40:3.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja40:4.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja40:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja40:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja40:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja40:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja40:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja40:0.3": "Kulāvakavagga ", "ja40:0.4": "10. Khadiraṅgārajātaka ", "ja40:1.1": "“Kāmaṁ patāmi nirayaṁ, ", "ja40:1.2": "uddhampādo avaṁsiro; ", "ja40:1.3": "Nānariyaṁ karissāmi, ", "ja40:1.4": "handa piṇḍaṁ paṭiggahā”ti. ", "ja40:2.1": "Khadiraṅgārajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja40:2.2": "Kulāvakavaggo catuttho. ", "ja40:3.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja40:4.1": "Sirimātali dhītara pakkhivaro, ", "ja40:4.2": "Ratiyāgato mātāpitā ca puna; ", "ja40:4.3": "Jagatīruha vuḍḍha sukakkaṭako, ", "ja40:4.4": "Tathā nandakapiṇḍavarena dasāti. "}, "translation_text": {"ja40:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 40 ", "ja40:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja40:0.3": "Nests ", "ja40:0.4": "The Pit of Acacia Coals: a past life story ", "ja40:1.1": "Fine, let me fall ", "ja40:1.2": "head over heels into hell, ", "ja40:1.3": "but I shall not do what is ignoble. ", "ja40:1.4": "Please accept my alms offering. ", "ja40:2.1": "", "ja40:2.2": "", "ja40:3.1": "", "ja40:4.1": "", "ja40:4.2": "", "ja40:4.3": "", "ja40:4.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja40:0.1": "", "ja40:0.2": "", "ja40:0.3": "", "ja40:0.4": "", "ja40:1.1": "ms22J_86, msdiv40, pts-vp-pli1.233, vri68.10", "ja40:1.2": "", "ja40:1.3": "", "ja40:1.4": "", "ja40:2.1": "ms22J_87", "ja40:2.2": "", "ja40:3.1": "ms22J_88", "ja40:4.1": "ms22J_89", "ja40:4.2": "", "ja40:4.3": "", "ja40:4.4": ""}, "keys_order": ["ja40:0.1", "ja40:0.2", "ja40:0.3", "ja40:0.4", "ja40:1.1", "ja40:1.2", "ja40:1.3", "ja40:1.4", "ja40:2.1", "ja40:2.2", "ja40:3.1", "ja40:4.1", "ja40:4.2", "ja40:4.3", "ja40:4.4"]}